{
  "$schema": "bond-protocol-vectors-v1",
  "category": "activities",
  "description": "RawActivityInput payloads for POST /api/v1/risk/analyses (sent as the `activity` member alongside `agentId`). `input` uses canonical camelCase keys; each runner maps to its SDK builder input and asserts the built payload deep-equals `expected`. Invalid vectors assert deterministic client-side INVALID_ACTIVITY_INPUT in both SDKs. All values synthetic; no secrets.",
  "valid": [
